// This message file contains text to be used in game-supplied notes.
// Only the message line numbers 1000 or higher are valid
// Each new note begins on a multiple of 10, and can use up to 10
// lines, which must be consecutive. Each line appears in the note
// as a paragraph.

{1000}{My dearest Raven,

Although I must leave on my search for the Dark Elves, I shall keep the moments we shared safely in my heart.  I can only hope that one day we will again walk the trees of Qintarra hand in hand.

Forever I am yours,

Renford A. Terwilliger}

{1010}{You have came to the wrong place traveler. Legend of Undead most be somewhere with sign of evil... Find the Dark Halfing Village, answer to your questions must be there.

Search till end of black magics, disperse is the only way to end of the evil,

Gregth Z.}

{1011}{Come into the village south of you, we have an important meeting. I welcome you at anytime.

Your friend - Zen'-Rength}

{1020}{Greeting to you traveler, you have came to wrong place. Death Diamond aren't here. Keep searching!

-Trater Hizard}

{1030}{Dear Sir. George,

I was hoping you already solved the problem with undeads. I have an important information about these undeads right now, come into city of Surnthria and find me. Don't forget to take the ring with you.

-Your friend, Trater Hizard}

{1040}{Protect the damned lord at all the cost! Kill whoever's in the mines, all hail to black magic!

-T.S.}

{1050}{Kill the saver of dark magic. You know who, he'll run into the town soon as he got the note. Don't let him speak to Zen'-Rength, once he did, everything's over... EVERY BLACK MAGIC! Kill him on sight. All hail to black magic.}

-T.S.}